# Scoped to seshat-console's Dockerfile now that its build context is the
# repo root (see Dockerfile's own comment) — BuildKit picks this file over
# the root ../.dockerignore because it sits alongside seshat-console/Dockerfile.
# Needs seshat-console/ + shared/ only; everything else in the monorepo is
# irrelevant to this build and would only slow down the context transfer.
.git
.github
.claude
docs
website
seshat-ui
seshat-backend
seshat-server
helps
private
project
scripts
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.log
**/.seshat
